  "_comment": [
    "The homebrew catalogue the CHIP-8 window can fetch, and the reason it is a",
    "list rather than a search: every entry here was read and cleared one at a",
    "time. The source repository states a blanket CC0 dedication ('everything in",
    "this repository is placed under the Creative Commons 0 license'), and the",
    "commit is pinned so the bytes cannot change under a running application.",
    "Adding a program is adding an entry: name the file, the author, and the",
    "licence that permits redistribution. An entry without a licence does not",
    "belong here."
